
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Hacker World</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #07352a, #020807 70%);
    color: #00ff88;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

.page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-evenly;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px 12px;
    gap: 25px;
}

h1, h2 {
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ff88, 0 0 22px #00ff88;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(25px, 6vw, 48px);
    animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

h2 {
    font-size: clamp(17px, 4vw, 25px);
}

.scene {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    width: min(95vw, 650px);
    min-height: 330px;
    border: 1px solid #00ff88;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 20, 13, 0.8);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #00ff8840;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.hacker {
    z-index: 2;
    width: 180px;
    height: 210px;
    border-radius: 90px 90px 25px 25px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #174b3c, #020605);
    border: 2px solid #00ff88;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px #00ff8870;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}

.face {
    font-size: 75px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px #00ff88);
}

.laptop {
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-top: 5px;
}

.computer {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 43px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 9px #00ff88);
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.c1 { top: 25px; left: 20px; }
.c2 { top: 35px; right: 20px; animation-delay: .5s; }
.c3 { bottom: 25px; left: 25px; animation-delay: 1s; }
.c4 { bottom: 25px; right: 25px; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
.c5 { top: 45%; left: 8px; }
.c6 { top: 45%; right: 8px; }

.code {
    width: min(90vw, 550px);
    min-height: 65px;
    padding: 18px;
    border-left: 3px solid #00ff88;
    background: #00150d;
    color: #a2ffca;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow: hidden;
}

footer {
    color: #75cfa2;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

@keyframes glow {
    from { opacity: .7; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-9px); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="page">

    <h1>WELCOME TO MY NEW WORLD</h1>

    <h2>⚡ THE HACKER UNIVERSE ⚡</h2>

    <div class="scene">
        <span class="computer c1">🖥️</span>
        <span class="computer c2">💻</span>
        <span class="computer c3">🖥️</span>
        <span class="computer c4">💻</span>
        <span class="computer c5">⌨️</span>
        <span class="computer c6">🖥️</span>

        <div class="hacker">
            <div class="face">🕵️</div>
            <div class="laptop">💻</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="code">
        <div>&gt; Initializing the system...</div>
        <div>&gt; Welcome to my digital universe.</div>
        <div>&gt; Explore. Learn. Create.</div>
        <div>&gt; Status: ONLINE_</div>
    </div>

    <h2>THINK DIFFERENT • CODE SMART</h2>

    <footer>MY WORLD • MY CODE • MY FUTURE</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
